{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Levantar La Botella&quot; means &quot;stand the bottle&quot;, a classic Taiwanese night market game where you use a ring hanging from a stick to skilfully lift a bottle into a standing position.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is famously addictive at the night market, so I thought: why not turn it into a game? Now, I can relive the fun anytime, anywhere \u2014 and so can you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is my love letter \ud83d\udc8c to my home country. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I enjoyed making it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+--------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Control\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0| Action\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0| Keys\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0|</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+--------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Tilt The Handle\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 | Left, Right\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0| Q, E\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 | Up, Down\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 | W, S\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0|</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 | Forward, Backward\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0| A, D\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+--------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Move\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 | Forward, Backward\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0| UP \u2191, DOWN \u2193\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 | Left, Right\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0| LEFT \u2190, RIGHT \u2192\u00a0 |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+---------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Camera\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 | Look around\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 | Mouse \ud83d\uddb1\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+---------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714060?t=1764244675","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714060?t=1764244675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714060/2fe99dc0e1ef1de09c12f8221719a46b6dc22187/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764244675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714060/2fe99dc0e1ef1de09c12f8221719a46b6dc22187/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764244675","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes